     H Debug(*Yes) TruncNbr(*Yes) AlwNull(*UsrCtl)
     H DftActGrp(*No) ActGrp(*Caller)
     H Option(*SrcStmt : *NoDebugIO)  ExprOpts(*ResDecPos)
     H BndDir('SGSRC/XML850R_AR')
     F**********************************************************************
     F*  Author         - Chris Hutchinson / Pro I.T. Resource Group, Inc. *
     F*                   chutchinson@proitrg.com  |  800-545-7630         *
     F*                        www.proitrg.com     |  336-420-0329         *
     F*  Program Name   - XML850R_AR                                       *
     F*  Program Date   - 05/14/2019                                       *
     F*  Source Library - QRPGLESRC/SGSRC                                  *
     F*  Object Lirary  - SGPGM                                            *
     F*  Program Descr  - Process incoming cXML order transactions for     *
     F*                   imported orders - new only - change requests     *
     F*                   have not been implemented yet.                   *
     F*                                                                    *
     F*  NOTE:  Elements with attributes were broken down as on page 67    *
     F*         of Scott Klement's "Web Services and XML for RPGers.pdf"   *
     F*         at 'https://www.scottklement.com/presentations/Web%20      *
     F*         Services%20and%20XML%20for%20RPGers.pdf'                   *
     F*                                                                    *
     F**********************************************************************
     F*                                                                    *
     F*  MODIFICATIONS                                                     *
     F*                                                                    *
     F*  10/14/2020  CDH   Modified the path handling to use the download  *
     F*                    path specified in ARPEGGIO SFTP software for    *
     F*                    the server definition defined for the retailer. *
     F*                                                                    *
     F*  06/05/2023  CDH   Modified the date required for the order coming *
     F*                    in to be handled with the new logic Bill        *
     F*                    provided.  It is now based on the part class or *
     F*                    the item to determine the number of days added  *
     F*                    to the date required.  It also accounts for     *
     F*                    holidays as specified in the user defined code  *
     F*                    table.                                          *
     F*                                                                    *
     F**********************************************************************

      * HarrisData Customer Master File
     FHDCUST    IF   E           K Disk

      * HarrisData Item Master File
     FHDIMST    IF   E           K Disk

      * HarrisData Item Plant Master File
     FHDIPLT    IF   E           K Disk

      * HarrisData Iterm Warehouse Master File
     FHDIWHS    IF   E           K Disk

      * HarrisData Order Flags Master
     FHDORFG    IF   E           K Disk

      * HarrisData Ship Via Master
     FHDSHPV    IF   E           K Disk

      * HarrisData Cost Summary Master File
     FHDMCMM    IF   E           K Disk

      * HarrisData Tax Definition File
     FHDTAXD    IF   E           K Disk

      * HarrisData Order Header Work File
     FOEHDWK    UF A E           K Disk

      * HarrisData Order Detail Work File
     FOEDTWK    O    E             Disk    Block(*NO)

      * HarrisData Order Comment Work File
     FOECMWK    UF A E           K Disk    Block(*NO)

      * Arpeggio SFTP Software - Server Definition File
      * (for download path)
     FAFSVR1P   IF   E           K Disk

      * XML Orders Header Master
     FXMLOEHD   O    E             Disk    Block(*NO)

      * XML Orders Header Master
     FXMLOEDT   O    E             Disk    Block(*NO)

